message: "If you use this catalog, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Clinical Data Atlas"
authors:
  - family-names: Pacheco-Barrios
    given-names: Niels
repository-code: "https://github.com/nielspac177/clinical-data-atlas"
url: "https://nielspac177.github.io/clinical-data-atlas/"
license: MIT
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-23
abstract: >-
  Clinical Data Atlas is a living, monthly-refreshed catalog of open and
  gated clinical and neuroscience datasets, presented as an interactive
  3D knowledge graph and a filterable table. It is metadata only: it
  catalogs datasets and links out to them, and never hosts or
  redistributes their contents. The pipeline code is MIT-licensed and the
  catalog's own metadata (not the underlying datasets) is released under
  CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - clinical-data
  - neuroscience
  - dataset-catalog
  - open-data
  - data-discovery
  - neuroimaging
  - knowledge-graph
  - metadata
